{"id":"STm10001_11","names":{"0":"","1":"","Coppelius the High Priest":"Coppelius the High Priest","Leita the Saintess":"Leita the Saintess","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg1_162":"Alina","avg2_942":"Coppelius","avg2_978":"Rovina","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_1335":"Filanis Citizen Male","avg3_182":"Elis","avg3_225":"Leita","avg3_227":"Filanis Elder","avg3_228":"Filanis Citizen (M)"},"en":{"0":"","1":"","Coppelius the High Priest":"Coppelius the High Priest","Leita the Saintess":"Leita the Saintess","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg1_162":"Alina","avg2_942":"Coppelius","avg2_978":"Rovina","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_1335":"Filanis Citizen Male A","avg3_182":"Elis","avg3_225":"Leita","avg3_227":"Filanis Elder","avg3_228":"Filanis Citizen (M)"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Eleven","Wishes and Sacrifices","Elis explains the Emor Night Watchers' corruption, which leaves Alina shocked. Alina longs to revive her fallen companions through wishes. You attempt to make a wish in the tower, only to fall into grave danger…"],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","story_main_10001_005",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_520"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["head","18:50, The Fifth Month 26th, Outside Filanis Island, Woodland Cemetery"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.5],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Wait. If there's no fire, the Night Watchers start one themselves and charge the neighbors to put it out?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-70.0,1.4,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","And when a house in a prime location catches fire, they pressure the owner into selling the deed for a tenth of its value before putting the fire out, then fix the place up and sell it?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-120.0,1.6,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","And when they catch a thief, they check the stolen goods first, counting on nobles to pay a fortune to keep their dirty secrets quiet?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-180.0,1.8,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","And they rough up the smarter thieves and let them walk, because \"without thieves, nobody would hire Night Watchers to catch them\"?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_067"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["w",1.5],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["se","se_230"],["bg","mood_5",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","013","resentful",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","What kind of crooked schemes are those?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_1",5,0.0],["show","avg3_182","b","021",null,null,null,5,null,1.0],["stage",5,0,4],["bgm","m11"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","021","music",null,null,null,null,"xuanyun","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","That's how Emor's Night Watchers have always done it. Even Priests have paid them firefighting fees.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,5],["bg","story_main_10001_005",0,0.5],["hide","avg3_182"],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","E-Even the Priests...?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["show","avg3_182","b","005",0.25,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,"sigh",0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Priests don't want the trouble. Sure, every Night Watcher in the city together still wouldn't stand a chance against a single Priest, but mosquitoes buzzing around you all day get annoying, don't they? And it's not like you can just kill them.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_182","b","018",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Besides, a fee that small is pocket change to a Priest.",0,""],["se","se_147"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","With Priests leading the way, everyone else pays up without a word. So that's how Night Watchers in other cities make their money. No wonder Elis said...",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_182","b","020",null,-0.35,1.5,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","020","exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Thankless? Please. Where there's power, the gold follows. As for why Alina is dead broke... Your guess is as good as mine.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","story_main_10001_005",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["show","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Elis, the people you're describing aren't Night Watchers. They're extortionists.==W== That's right. What they're doing is nothing but extortion.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_251"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Such vile, filthy methods...==W== As Captain of the Filanis Night Watchers, I will never stoop to them!",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","013",null,null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"OutCubic",0.3],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,200.0,null,1.2,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,0.75,-0.55,2.0,0.9,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["show","avg3_182","b","015",0.35,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","015","sweaty",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_182","I didn't tell you to use them! I'm explaining how Emor's Night Watchers make their money. An honest blockhead like you could never pull it off anyway.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","And that also explains why every Night Watcher in Filanis ran off.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-100.0,-30.0,1.1,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_182","b","020","exclamation",0.35,-0.15,1.2,null,"jushou2","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","You might be fine working for nothing, Alina, but most people have to eat. If the city won't pay them, they'll find their own way to make a living.",0,""],["bgm",""],["se","se_147"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,1.0,"lengzhan","OutCubic",0.5],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","017","vexation",0.65,-0.15,1.2,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",1.5],["bgm","m12"],["mrt",2,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Can't we get the people of Filanis to help you? With kids going missing... Everyone must be terrified, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,0.3,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014",null,0.53,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I'm sorry, that won't be easy either. You saw how it is...==W== The people on the island are hostile toward Night Watchers...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["show","avg3_228","a","004",0.25,-0.35,1.5,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_227","a","004",0.53,-0.45,1.5,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_1335","a","002",0.85,-0.35,-1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_1335","a",null,null,null,null,-1.6,0.8,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg3_228","a",null,null,null,null,1.6,0.8,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg3_227","a",null,null,null,null,1.6,0.8,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_1335","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["hide","avg3_1335",0.5],["ctl","avg3_228","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["hide","avg3_228",0.5],["ctl","avg3_227","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["hide","avg3_227",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","The people outside the island are kind enough to me, but they have to work nonstop every day just to afford that day's bread. They can't spare any help for us.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["hide","avg3_182",0],["w",0.5],["chd",0,0,"avg3_182","b","015","sweaty"],["say","avg3_182","Even if they could, we couldn't let them. Sending ordinary people who can't use magic after vicious slavers would be a terrible idea.",0,""],["w",0.5],["chd",1,0,"avg3_182","a","002",null],["se","se_124"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Before you two agreed to join the Night Watchers, I was at a loss.==W== But now that you're here, I have a plan.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","question",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","==PLAYER_NAME==, Elis, can I leave the patrols outside the island to you?==W== Lulu will show you what to do. Don't worry, Filanis is peaceful most of the time now.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_087"],["show","avg2_978","b","002",0.25,-0.15,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg2_978","b",null,null,null,-0.15,1.4,0.8,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_978","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["hide","avg2_978",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I'll investigate the disappearances on the island alone. I'll disguise myself, take a room, and watch the streets in secret every night. If I keep at it, I'm bound to find the culprit's trail.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","All by yourself? What about during the day? Those people could make a move in daylight, too.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_257"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I'll watch the streets during the day as well.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","How are you supposed to keep watch day and night all on your own?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","By not sleeping!",0,""],["w",0.5],["chd",0,0,"avg3_182","b","027","shock"],["w",0.5],["chd",1,0,"avg3_182","a","002",null],["se","se_080"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Please don't worry about me. Back in the arena, there were times I went three or four days without sleep. I'm used to it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","But...==W== Nobody knows how long this investigation will take. Are you planning to stay awake until it's over?",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","002","question",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_street_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["stg",0,null,100.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.8,null,null,null],["se","se_235"],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","For the peace of Filanis,==W== and to fulfill my companions' wishes...==W== I will endure. I have to.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_235"],["bg","story_main_10001_004_04",0,1.0],["cbg",0,-500.0,200.0,1.5,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,-100.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["goon"],["w",1.0],["se","se_048"],["tsk","Xiao"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_251"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","015",null,null,null,null,1.0,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I cannot bear to see innocent children kidnapped.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_10001_005",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Besides, I've built up a lot of merit over the past year. Once I catch this culprit,==W== I'll earn the chance to enter the tower and make my wish.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_029"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","008",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["bg","phylanis_tower_gate_daylight",0,0.5],["cbg",0,null,90.0,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_10001_005",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Elis was right. No matter how hard I fought in that match, the outcome would not have changed. There's no use regretting it.",0,""],["stg",0,null,null,1.3,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","If I don't want my future self to have any more regrets, I must work twice as hard, see every task through, and seize every opportunity!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","015","think