 back from the dead?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","012","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Well...==W== I... I'm not sure. Resurrection requires preserving both body and soul. It's always been the most dangerous branch of magic. Hardly anyone dares to study it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Of the few mages on record who researched it...==W== The lucky ones accomplished nothing and wasted their whole lives. As for the ones who uncovered anything at all... Every single one of them was cursed and turned into a monster.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","027","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_061"],["bg","phylanis_street_outside_night",1,0.0],["cbg",1,600.0,-500.0,1.5,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_182","b","004",null,0.7,-0.3,1.35,null,"JuGong","OutQuad",0.6],["stage",1,0,0],["say","avg3_182","The tower has granted plenty of bizarre wishes, sure.==W== People have used wishes to boil a great lake dry, wipe out an entire city, and even fly straight to the ends of the earth in a single leap.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.3],["stage",1,1,1],["ctl","avg3_182","b","002",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.8],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Fly to the ends of the earth... If the Monolith here can do all that, could I use a wish to get back to my own world?",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","027",null,null,null,null,null,"jinzhang","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","But when it comes to resurrection, the Saintess Academy never taught a single case like that, and I've never heard of anyone wishing for it...",0,""],["show","avg1_162","a","005",0.82,-0.16,1.2,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,0.6,null,null,1.0,"JuGong","OutSine",0.5],["w",0.2],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","027",null,0.25,0.03,0.95,null,null,"OutBack",0.74],["stg",0,100.0,null,1.15,"OutQuad",0.8,null,null,null],["w",1],["se","se_080"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Then let me be the first. Even if it fails... At least I'll have paved the way for whoever comes after me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Something's off... If Elis has never heard of anyone wishing for resurrection, maybe it's not because nobody's tried. Maybe every attempt ended so badly that everyone who knew kept their mouths shut.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","010",null,null],["say","avg3_100","A wish like that is bound to demand a massive price. If Alina goes in armed with nothing but blind courage, this won't end well...==W== I need to find a way to stop her.",2,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",0,"y","029","exclamation","diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,0.21,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.6],["stg",0,-200.0,-50.0,1.25,"OutQuad",0.6,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["mrt",1,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Alina, haven't you been asking me about the trick to making wishes? Before you earn enough merit, let me show you how it's done myself.",1,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","017","music","daintou"],["say","avg3_100","If all goes well, we might even solve the Filanis disappearances while we're at it.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","question",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Huh? You're going to make a wish, too?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.